\newlabel{fig:go}{{9}{7}{GO Biological Process enrichment for conserved Crypt SI markers (green) and conserved Top villous SI markers (red). Bars show $-\log _{10}$(adjusted p-value). Red dashed line marks the p=0.05 significance threshold}{figure.caption.9}{}}
